those fish while the tenant did dialysis. Everybody in the passage knows how I pay rent. Nobody knew I had his spare key until I gave it to the housing worker.","appearance":"On an ordinary day, look for an unlined tan jacket and a train token tied to a zipper pull. Denny has a strong profile and a little space between the front teeth, with a soft fringe that falls across one eyebrow. Denny rubs a thumb along the edge of the nearest pocket during a conversation.","personality":"Denny treats a small promise with the gravity others reserve for a contract. This makes Denny lovely to rely on and surprisingly difficult to invite on a whim.","agenda":"To keep the fish alive and reopen contact with the displaced tenant.","family":"Marina Carvalho is Denny’s older cousin. Denny makes room at the table. Marina brings whatever was actually growing or affordable that week. The meal sometimes produces a solution. Even when it does not, everyone goes away knowing what the other household is up against. Asked about *Saturday keys*, Marina says, “I keep an emergency key list in my hymn book.”","connections":"Bina Marsh. A surrendered spare key gives the housing worker a way to call a displaced man from beside his own fish.","familyIds":["AH-R0289"],"connectionIds":["AH-R0045"],"reactions":[{"situation":"A reporter asks which neighbor held the aquarium key","response":"Denny asks whether the tenant wants the key holder named before saying anything to the reporter.","asWritten":"A reporter asks which neighbor held the aquarium key. Denny asks whether the tenant wants the key holder named before saying anything to the reporter."},{"situation":"A frightened child is waiting outside a shuttered shop","response":"Denny asks the nearest shop worker to stay too, then talks about ordinary things until the child can explain who is late.","asWritten":"A frightened child is waiting outside a shuttered shop. Denny asks the nearest shop worker to stay too, then talks about ordinary things until the child can explain who is late."},{"situation":"When offered a favor with ambiguous terms","response":"Denny says what can be returned and asks whether that will do.","asWritten":"When offered a favor with ambiguous terms, Denny says what can be returned and asks whether that will do."}]},"appearanceSource":"photo measurements and biography"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_ponytail01","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"name":"Cloth_jacket","skin":0},{"mesh":8,"name":"Cloth_tshirt","skin":0},{"mesh":9,"name":"Cloth_jeans","skin":0},{"mesh":10,"name":"Cloth_shoes","skin":0}],"meshes":[{"name":"base","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_male","muscle_max","height_short","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_incr","face_jaw_width_incr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_size_decr","face_eye_spacing_incr","face_eye_tilt_incr","face_lips_incr","face_mouth_width_incr","face_ear_size_decr","face_forehead_decr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_gender_male__muscle_max"]},"weights":[0.85,0.1945,0.3154,0.1916,0.2241,0.3475,0.3176,0.1632,0.0368,0.066,0.3201,0.7542,0.0272,0.4136,0.5406,0,0,0.16532],"primitives":[{"attributes":{"POSITION":2,"NORMAL":3,"TEXCOORD_0":4,"JOINTS_0":5,"WEIGHTS_0":6},"indices":1,"material":0,"targets":[{"POSITION":7,"NORMAL":8},{"POSITION":9,"NORMAL":10},{"POSITION":11,"NORMAL":12},{"POSITION":13,"NORMAL":14},{"POSITION":15,"NORMAL":16},{"POSITION":17,"NORMAL":18},{"POSITION":19,"NORMAL":20},{"POSITION":21,"NORMAL":22},{"POSITION":23,"NORMAL":24},{"POSITION":25,"NORMAL":26},{"POSITION":27,"NORMAL":28},{"POSITION":29,"NORMAL":30},{"POSITION":31,"NORMAL":32},{"POSITION":33,"NORMAL":34},{"POSITION":35,"NORMAL":36},{"POSITION":37,"NORMAL":38},{"POSITION":39,"NORMAL":40},{"POSITION":41,"NORMAL":42}]}]},{"name":"Eyebrows","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_male","muscle_max","height_short","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_incr","face_jaw_width_incr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_size_decr","face_eye_spacing_incr","face_eye_tilt_incr","fa